  - title: 02 / Configure dispatch
    explanation: Calibrate and configure the reserve, generator start threshold and
      shedding order before enabling AUTO.
    caption: "RESERVE  \u2022  START LIMIT  \u2022  PRIORITY"
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.18, y: 0.6}
      label: CALIBRATE
