  - title: 03 / Survive the emergency
    explanation: Observe solar loss and islanding. Apply the surge, then fail the
      generator and watch priority shedding.
    caption: "CLOUD COVER  \u2192  OUTAGE  \u2192  SURGE"
    parts:
    - id: input
      kind: 9
